          "title": "Pozdravi",
          "titleEn": "Greetings",
          "grammarTip": "Bosnian distinguishes informal address (ti) from formal or plural address (vi): 'Kako si?' (asking one person you're informal with) vs 'Kako ste?' (formal, or speaking to more than one person). The word 'molim' does double duty — it means 'please' when asking for something, and 'you're welcome' when replying to 'hvala'.",
